    <div>
      <p>The bot and the admin API are separate FastAPI processes built from the same image. They share PostgreSQL but not a request path. The bot owns Telegram updates and business writes. The admin panel is a read surface for state, access, services, journal, errors, and AI spend. Access is the main write surface, with a few explicit recovery actions.</p>
